      "id": "claim_248dc73786274696a0d66c2dd42252d8",
      "statement": "InterviewView is a six-phase state machine (connecting, streaming, complete, submitting, recorded, failed): a mount-time useEffect creates a session then opens the question stream and appends chunks; an AbortController in cleanup aborts on unmount; a failure shows in place and the answer control never opens.",
