    {
      "id": "claim_c0e849ee6d814d018ddeffc3c54f6055",
      "statement": "The view reads the event stream with fetch and a ReadableStream rather than EventSource, so the transport is a function tests replace and the parser is exercised on the chunk boundaries a real network produces; interface copy is English until M5.",
